{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-33","kind":"proposition","title":"一线上求作圆分而负圆分角与所设直线角等","englishTitle":"On a given straight line to describe a segment of a circle admitting an angle equal to a given rectilineal angle.","book":3,"number":33,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.33","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.33/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":33,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","contentId":"euclid-3-33","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"16666e12eece44f23fdbf92143abeae68c5a9fa0b2a4ae8693cf051c1bfbcab8","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-33.statement","euclid-3-33.construction.1","euclid-3-33.proof.1","euclid-3-33.proof.2","euclid-3-33.construction.2","euclid-3-33.proof.3","euclid-3-33.proof.4","euclid-3-33.construction.3","euclid-3-33.proof.5","euclid-3-33.proof.6","euclid-3-33.proof.7","euclid-3-33.proof.8","euclid-3-33.proof.9","euclid-3-33.construction.4","euclid-3-33.proof.10","euclid-3-33.proof.11","euclid-3-33.proof.12","euclid-3-33.proof.13","euclid-3-33.proof.14","euclid-3-33.proof.15","euclid-3-33.proof.16","euclid-3-33.proof.17","euclid-3-33.proof.18","euclid-3-33.proof.19","euclid-3-33.proof.20","euclid-3-33.proof.21","euclid-3-33.conclusion","euclid-3-33.historical.1","euclid-3-33.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-33.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2301a24faa1d69ebb393e99518aa83c606c5e08e2c452c72f93bf0e3b41ed7d6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"On a given straight line to describe a segment of a circle admitting an angle equal to a given rectilineal angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在给定直线上描述一个圆的一段,其中含有等于给定直线角的角。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一线上求作圜分而负圜分角与所设直线角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在一条线上绘制弧线，负弧角等于所设置直线的角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1301889db830f8f56d805d469725bf57c71d7fb2d0205ca47d5def061320301c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the given straight line, and the angle at C the given rectilineal angle; thus it is required to describe on the given straight line AB a segment of a circle admitting an angle equal to the angle at C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB是给定的直线,让C为给定的直线角;因此,必须在给定的直线AB上描述一个圆的段,其中一个角等于C的角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b6b1661c112dd7eb0707abf83ed70d341f1fc6caa97a256b9f7f3a1d98caaef8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The angle at C is then acute, or right, or obtuse."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C角是急性的,右侧或斜角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dbba9f35d00d1af69f54caf795252f5cbd1075bb623ef4a88bff6cc32f1c68e2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First let it be acute, and, as in the first figure, on the straight line AB, and at the point A, let the angle BAD be constructed equal to the angle at C; therefore the angle BAD is also acute."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让它变得尖锐,正如第一个数字,在AB线上,在A点,让BAD角等于C角;因此,BAD角也是尖锐的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a45d0b44a51c706a883fe1e83a03beaa125f453e0089a1cde115de0d09b729c8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AE be drawn at right angles to DA, let AB be bisected at F, let FG be drawn from the point F at right angles to AB, and let GB be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们在直角至DA时抽取AE让AB在F处被两分开从直角至AB时的F点抽取FG让GB连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dc3f99de9821b7d155cee912efde2c071901e9960fcfebd13fe251e9ae9c65b9","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AF is equal to FB, and FG is common, the two sides AF, FG are equal to the two sides BF, FG; and the angle AFG is equal to the angle BFG; therefore the base AG is equal to the base BG. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AF等于FB,FG是共同的,双方AF,FG等于BF,FG;AFG的角等于BFG;因此,底边,AG等于底边,BG。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e581d78fd7d8581f64bc41cf3a5e7b62ed5382091b855c2954feb86289b81d72","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the circle described with centre G and distance GA will pass through B also."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,以G中心和GA距离为主的圆圈也将穿过B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f897b5c80b2663532bd1aa115728f081db2b18e0ce55f0367943246adf883c8c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be drawn, and let it be ABE; let EB be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它画,让它画ABE;让EB连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"26efa551647906e92b48287550a984e691649be99e16c998bcdf521161b665b8","citations":["euclid-3-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AD is drawn from A, the extremity of the diameter AE, at right angles to AE, therefore AD touches the circle ABE. [[III. 16, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,AD是从A中抽取的,直径AE,直角至AE,因此,AD触摸了ABE圆。 [[III. 16, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cab58b3eb81984b62bac985edf67e5193b454cbf7ba46b9cb97d0620512980a3","citations":["euclid-3-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then a straight line AD touches the circle ABE, and from the point of contact at A a straight line AB is drawn across in the circle ABE, the angle DAB is equal to the angle AEB in the alternate segment of the circle. [[III. 32](/principles/euclid-3-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,一条直线AD触摸了ABE圆,从A接触点,在ABE圆中划过一条直线AB,角度DAB等于圆的交替部分的角AEB。 [[III. 32](/principles/euclid-3-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6df9cbef6e1afd66bb32a4327257e38b0b69af5e5921a07bde354277328e1846","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle DAB is equal to the angle at C; therefore the angle at C is also equal to the angle AEB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DAB角等于C角,因此C角也等于AEB角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a6de2d628e9076b0ff3a74d80573abf2188d91404eb35adcfc217e95907633e9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore on the given straight line AB the segment AEB of a circle has been described admitting the angle AEB equal to the given angle, the angle at C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在给定的直线AB上,对圆的AEB段作了描述,承认了与给定角AEB相等的角,即C角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"09320574ee56d986dc18818814fc368f9a48b8e4cb4ea71b4222e36b3c9c6b32","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next let the angle at C be right; and let it be again required to describe on AB a segment of a circle admitting an angle equal to the right angle at C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,C角应该正确;AB角应该再次说明一个圆的一段,其中的一段角等于C角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":13,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dcadbfe337e11da34c49e8eb53b4fcf5bd09a0cdbb37fb81f70ac6d7c04cbf19","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angle BAD be constructed equal to the right angle at C, as is the case in the second figure; let AB be bisected at F, and with centre F and distance either FA or FB let the circle AEB be described."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BAD角等于直角,C,第二个数字就是如此;AB角等于F,F角等于2,FA角等于AEB圆,FA角等于FB角等于AEB角等于BAD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ffd41e1bcfc3f69daec84b86a460c85d0bbfb1d57054e29fd6c889af264462c1","citations":["euclid-3-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the straight line AD touches the circle ABE, because the angle at A is right. [[III. 16, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AD线直线触摸了ABE圆,因为A角是正确的。 [[III. 16, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0aa6465f645cfb4f1e0e3d3844c854eecd3f856b574c9ee951a44641051ef4f7","citations":["euclid-3-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the angle BAD is equal to the angle in the segment AEB, for the latter too is itself a right angle, being an angle in a semicircle. [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BAD角度相当于AEB段的角度,后者本身也是直角角度,是半圆形的一个角度。 [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"56937f5f03d8b4e0853252d180bd2aa6e23bba71c4cf208f420d5df8e0a649b0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle BAD is also equal to the angle at C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BAD角也等于C角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25053a5344513c6c3cf84a05dad4af33b70d1ede633f81c874e3b690b3678a18","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle AEB is also equal to the angle at C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AEB角也等于C角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3c5d92cf1da7a82739178665bf8de848b939e94a4394b6d38ef2934a0da0ee40","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore again the segment AEB of a circle has been described on AB admitting an angle equal to the angle at C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB页再次说明了圆圈的AEB段,其中承认一个与C页角相等的角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1917809bc2b5a835ec44bbd0e0855d973825e7c508781f1487af9ed0a5a0f2df","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let the angle at C be obtuse; and on the straight line AB, and at the point A, let the angle BAD be constructed equal to it, as is the case in the third figure; let AE be drawn at right angles to AD, let AB be again bisected at F, let FG be drawn at right angles to AB, and let GB be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,在C角上,不要划掉;在AB直线上,在A点,像第三个数字那样,把BAD角构造成等于它;在直角至AD划出AE,在F划出AB,再划出FG,在直角至AB划出FG,并连接GB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"36a29e8b711f4f69089bef5bd024429614cf94b3b7607488ca804881e2e998cd","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AF is again equal to FB, and FG is common, the two sides AF, FG are equal to the two sides BF, FG; and the angle AFG is equal to the angle BFG; therefore the base AG is equal to the base BG. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AF等于FB,FG是共同的,双方AF,FG等于BF,FG;AFG的角等于BFG;因此,底边,AG等于底边,BG。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e8bb3f1f7af3ad6928b71d9710034a615c81192769b7db57a5b5262d4863377","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the circle described with centre G and distance GA will pass through B also; let it so pass, as AEB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,以G中心和GA距离描述的圆圈也将通过B;让它通过,为AEB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ccd570cb267ffd7b76cfdb3e8ccbe8344662670ff3402541e34a3022de4078c5","citations":["euclid-3-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AD is drawn at right angles to the diameter AE from its extremity, AD touches the circle AEB. [[III. 16, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,AD被从它的极限 抽出直角到AE直径 AD触摸了AEB圆 [[III. 16, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0ab5aa5d2880eae05660cd5426ed1d737cd1ad433282c120a6b25cf926c5dce7","citations":["euclid-3-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And AB has been drawn across from the point of contact at A; therefore the angle BAD is equal to the angle constructed in the alternate segment AHB of the circle. [[III. 32](/principles/euclid-3-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是从A接触点对面画出的, 因此角度BAD等于圆的AHB交替段所构造的角度。 [[III. 32](/principles/euclid-3-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"23878024d2a4f35d35f53908556cc7be6cfcea3676f80de543bb142627fde4a6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle BAD is equal to the angle at C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BAD角等于C角"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bc1f5dbd860f8c3327e21c459942c5c960079685f04635d8e7d388d123bda71f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle in the segment AHB is also equal to the angle at C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,第AHB段的角也等于C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":26,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"414144901c9720bc863350341a52e5cf091d19bd8733cc653d78d7ccd9a218f6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore on the given straight line AB the segment AHB of a circle has been described admitting an angle equal to the angle at C. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在给定的直线AB上,圆的AHB段被描述为一个等于C、Q、E、F角的角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":27,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"45b3fcdfc20dbb3033cae7bd1f7c2e6bb76c7d3a83ba7a61494eec65b92c5cc1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一线上求作圜分而负圜分角与所设直线角等先法曰设甲乙线丙角求线上作圜分而负圜分角与丙等其丙角或直或锐或钝若直角先以甲乙两平分于丁次以丁为心甲乙为界作半圜圜分内作甲戊乙角即负半圜角为直角〈本篇卅一〉如所求次法曰若设丙锐角先于甲点上作丁甲乙锐角与丙等次作戊甲为甲丁之垂线于甲乙之上次作己乙甲角与己甲乙角等而乙己线与甲戊线遇于己即己乙己甲两线等〈一卷六〉末以己为心甲为界作甲庚圜必过乙即甲庚乙圜分内甲乙线上所作负圜角必为锐角而与丙等论曰试作甲庚乙角其甲己戊线过己心而丁甲又为戊甲之垂线即丁甲线切甲庚乙圜于甲〈本篇十六之系〉则丁甲乙与甲庚乙两角交互相等〈本篇卅二〉如所求后法曰若设辛钝角依前作壬甲乙钝角与辛等次作戊甲为壬甲之垂线馀仿第二法而于甲乙线上作甲癸乙等即与辛等后论同次"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"要在一条线上找到弧线，负弧角等于所设置直线的角度。首先，绘制方法如下：设线 甲乙 为角 丙。要找到线上的弧线，且负弧角等于 丙。丙 角可以是直角、锐角或钝角。如果先用 甲乙 在 丁 处平分直角，则使用 丁 为中心，以 甲乙 为边界，在半圆弧内绘制角，即负半圆角为直角 〈本篇卅一〉。按要求，绘制方法如下：如果先在点 甲 绘制 丙 的锐角，丁甲乙 是与 丙 的锐角，然后 戊甲 是与 甲丁 的垂线，再将 己乙甲 以相同角度绘制到 己甲乙，且 乙己 和 甲戊 直线在 己 相交，即 己乙己甲 在 〈一卷六〉 的末端相等，以 己 为中心、甲 为边界，甲庚 必须画圆。通过 乙，即在线 甲乙 上在 甲庚乙 的弧线内制作的负圆角必须是锐角，对 丙 等进行的证明如下：构造角 甲庚乙，其中线 甲己戊 通过 己 的中心，且 丁甲 也垂直于 戊甲，即线 丁甲 在 甲〈本篇十六之系〉 处切向 甲庚乙。然后 丁甲乙 和 甲庚乙 的角度平等交互。〈本篇卅二〉 按要求，绘制方法如下：如果钝角 辛 按之前创建的 壬甲乙 和 辛 的顺序制作，戊甲 垂直于 壬甲，且 壬甲 的残余仿制方法遵循第二种方法，则在 甲乙 线上绘制 甲癸乙 等，然后将和 辛 等进行讨论。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-33.source","contentId":"euclid-3-33","revisionId":"euclid-3-33@raw-16666e12eece44f2","order":28,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"22d210bd6e754265c8274aab72bbda95fb594d267f8daabc26551a21274f88ad","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath sour